ref=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:785e14ea-78ad-4583-9268-a5e64354b481\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:785e14ea-78ad-4583-9268-a5e64354b481\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-3baf9ac806cdd925END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-c6589963cb22df2bEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_HagsInformantNote_NoMayrina</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_HagsInformantNote_NoMayrina\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_HagsInformantNote_NoMayrina\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">974a42f2-00a9-4753-ac67-e5053d06b69b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:974a42f2-00a9-4753-ac67-e5053d06b69b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:974a42f2-00a9-4753-ac67-e5053d06b69b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Blushing_Mermaid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blushing Mermaid\">Blushing Mermaid</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-123&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-93</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading <b>Report on Old Garlow's</b> advances the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_Vanra\" title=\"Save Vanra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Save Vanra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Save_Vanra\" title=\"Save Vanra\">Save Vanra</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<dl><dd><i>If Mayrina was saved from Auntie Ethel</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_HagsInformantNote</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_HagsInformantNote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_HagsInformantNote\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">785e14ea-78ad-4583-9268-a5e64354b481</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:785e14ea-78ad-4583-9268-a5e64354b481\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:785e14ea-78ad-4583-9268-a5e64354b481\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p>Day One: I found <a href=\"/wiki/Mayrina\" title=\"Mayrina\">swamp-girl</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie</a>. Her and her little friends are hiding at Old Garlow's place - shaking like rattled babes. Your illusion worked perfectly, of course, and they welcomed me with open arms. They spent the day crying about hags - it's pathetic. They're no threat to you.\n</p><p><br>\nDay Two: Swamp-girl mentioned something about a book, but she won't tell me where it is. I'm investigating further - I'm sure it's nothing.\n</p><p>Day Three: They have it, Auntie, they have <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hag%27s_Bane\" title=\"The Hag's Bane\">the book</a></i>. I used your doll - the idiots are terrified. Once I find the book, I'll kill them. Don't worry, I'll take care of you, I'll take care of <i>everything</i>.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>If Mayrina died</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_HagsInformantNote_NoMayrina</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_HagsInformantNote_NoMayrina\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BlushingMermaid_HagsInformantNote_NoMayrina\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">974a42f2-00a9-4753-ac67-e5053d06b69b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:974a42f2-00a9-4753-ac67-e5053d06b69b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:974a42f2-00a9-4753-ac67-e5053d06b69b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p>Day One: I found them, <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie</a>. They were holed up in Old Garlow's place - shaking like rattled babes. Your illusion worked perfectly, of course, and they welcomed me with open arms. They spent the day crying about hags - it's pathetic. They're no threat to you.\n</p><p><br>\nDay Two: The <a href=\"/wiki/Adrielle\" title=\"Adrielle\">cleric</a> mentioned something about a book, but she won't tell me where it is. I'm investigating further - I'm sure it's nothing.\n</p><p><br>\nDay Three: They have it, Auntie, they have <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hag%27s_Bane\" title=\"The Hag's Bane\">the book</a></i>. I used your doll - the idiots are terrified. Once I find the book, I'll kill them. Don't worry, I'll take care of you, I'll take care of <i>everything</i>.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The text of this note is contingent on whether <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mayrina\" title=\"Mayrina\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Mayrina.png/25px-Portrait_Mayrina.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Mayrina.png/38px-Portrait_Mayrina.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Mayrina.png/50px-Portrait_Mayrina.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mayrina\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Portrait_Mayrina.png/25px-Portrait_Mayrina.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Portrait_Mayrina.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mayrina\" title=\"Mayrina\">Mayrina</a> survived or died after dealing with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/38px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/50px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Auntie Ethel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260